{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日パルコ劇場で16人のプリンシパル初日でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のfamilyが来てくださってて、有り難う御座います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントで、行けないけど応援してるよ！っていってくださったかた！\nとってもとっても心強かったです！\nありがと御座います！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲間やfamilyの方々の支えや声援で、毎日少しずつだけど成長しています！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"努力！感謝！笑顔！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で頑張ります！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうか...まあやを声援してくださる方に、少しでも笑顔が届きますように......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は個別握手会ですね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これない方で、会場にはいくよー！って方もいてくださいました\nそれもすごく嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのために、大切な時間をあけてくれて\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとはいまだに緊張するし。ちょっと照れるんですが、握手たのしかった！\n沢山パワーもらったし！\n幸せでhappyな気分になった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服は次回のせます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sorry"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも宜しくお願いします！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、公演の\n本番前！\nれなりんがフルーツを食べてて、\n『みてみてー』\nってケラケラ笑いながらいってきた！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりんの口に\nれいかちゃんの好きなキュウイを、縦に口にいれて\n一人でニコニコしてたよっ(o^−^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番前に皆を和ませてくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時の写メあるんだけど、\nなんかサイズオーバーはれないんだぁー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回はるねぇー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！\nどうでしたか？私のショートカットわ！？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では隣で、みなみが、あたしを呼んでいるのでここらへんで！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/6168377/0013.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}